# Residual CVEs in base image eclipse-temurin:25-jre-alpine (Alpine 3.24)
# These are in base packages not directly used by the IRS application.
# Dependabot will auto-update the pinned digest when a new build is published.
# Re-review: 2026-12-14 or when dependabot bumps the digest, whichever comes first.

# openssl 3.5.7-r0 — fixed version 3.5.8-r0 not yet available in Alpine 3.24
# QUIC server unbounded memory DoS; IRS API is HTTP-only, low real risk
CVE-2026-14456

# libexpat 2.8.3-r0 — fixed version 2.8.4-r0 not yet available in Alpine 3.24
# XML parsing DoS/memory corruption; expat is a base lib not used by the JVM directly
CVE-2026-76956
CVE-2026-76957
